      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "Unleashes a bolt of lunar energy in an arc dealing magic damage. Afflicts enemies struck with Moonlight, revealing them if they are not stealthed for 3 seconds.",
      "summary_zh": "释放一道月能光束，对弧形范围内的敌人造成伤害。 会对命中的敌人施加月光效果，如果中了月光效果的敌人不在潜行状态下，就会暴露在己方视野中3秒。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
