      "summary_en": "Diana reveals and draws in all nearby enemies and slows them. If Diana pulls in one or more enemy champions, the moonlight crashes down onto her after a short delay, dealing magic damage in an area around her, increased for each target beyond the first pulled.",
      "summary_zh": "黛安娜将附近所有敌人显形并拉拽到身边，然后使他们减速。 如果黛安娜将1个或以上的敌方英雄拉拽到身边，那么月光会在短暂延迟后倾注在她身上，在她附近的一个区域内造成魔法伤害，每拉拽一个额外目标就会使这个伤害提升。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
